Python 3.12+ infers variance for PEP 695 classes. Which line does mypy reject?

```python
class Box[T]:
    def __init__(self, v: T) -> None:
        self._v = v
    def get(self) -> T:
        return self._v

class MBox[T]:
    def __init__(self, v: T) -> None:
        self.v = v

b1: Box[int] = Box[bool](True)     # line 1
b2: MBox[int] = MBox[bool](True)   # line 2
```

